DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
12763::$$$message_0100_0000_0000$$$::As I'm walking around aimlessly looking for any leads...[lr]::
12764::$$$message_0100_0000_0001$$$::"Oh, what a coincidence, Emiya. What are you doing in a place like this?"[lr]::
12765::$$$message_0100_0000_0002$$$::I run into Mitsuzuri.::
12766::$$$message_0100_0001_0000$$$::"What do you mean by 'a place like this'? It's normal to take a walk in the park.[lr]::
12767::$$$message_0100_0001_0001$$$::I just wanted to take my mind off things. Aren't you taking a walk too?"::
12768::$$$message_0100_0002_0000$$$::"Me? I don't have that much free time[line len=2]oh, yeah. You do have a lot of time on your hands.[lr]::
12769::$$$message_0100_0002_0001$$$::All right, I'll give you a job then. Keep me company as my former kyudo club friend."[lr]::
12770::$$$message_0100_0002_0002$$$::"Huh?"::
12771::$$$message_0100_0003_0000$$$::"You remember the third-year, Saeda, right?"[lr]::
12772::$$$message_0100_0003_0001$$$::"Yeah. The kinda restless girl with a ponytail, right?"[lr]::
12773::$$$message_0100_0003_0002$$$::"Yeah. That girl suddenly had to get hospitalized, so I'm going to go visit her as the kyudo club representative."::
12774::$$$message_0100_0004_0000$$$::"Is it an injury?"[lr]::
12775::$$$message_0100_0004_0001$$$::"Haha. You always get worried about others.[lr]::
12776::$$$message_0100_0004_0002$$$::It's okay, it's just acute enteritis, so it's nothing serious."::
12777::$$$message_0100_0005_0000$$$::"So I was getting flowers and things to go visit...[cacheimage storage=美綴02b(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 storage=美綴02b(中) time=400]well, Matou is busy as the current captain, so I went to go buy them as the former captain."::
12778::$$$message_0100_0006_0000$$$::"Huh... Oh?"[lr]::
12779::$$$message_0100_0006_0001$$$::I open my eyes wide at the storefront of the flower shop.[lr]::
12780::$$$message_0100_0006_0002$$$::...Before, it was shabbier[line len=2]well, that's a bad way to put it, but it didn't seem bright at all.[lr]::
12781::$$$message_0100_0006_0003$$$::But, now it's like a different shop that I hardly recognize.::
12782::$$$message_0100_0007_0000$$$::"Welcome!"[lr]::
12783::$$$message_0100_0007_0001$$$::Oh, there's a new store clerk. They must be enthusiastic.[lr]::
12784::$$$message_0100_0007_0002$$$::A tall man in an apron comes out from behind the...[lr]::
12785::$$$message_0100_0007_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
12786::$$$message_0100_0007_0004$$$::It's someone...who...seems...like...a familiar face.::
12787::$$$message_0100_0008_0000$$$::Haha, could it be? There's no way he's a florist, it must be some doppelgänger.[lr]::
12788::$$$message_0100_0008_0001$$$::He wouldn't actually smile looking at me[line len=2][lr]::
12789::$$$message_0100_0008_0002$$$::"Oh, it's you, boy. What do you want?"[lr]::
12790::$$$message_0100_0008_0003$$$::...It's unmistakably him.::
12791::$$$message_0100_0009_0000$$$::"Oh... Um, well, can I ask what you're doing?"[lr]::
12792::$$$message_0100_0009_0001$$$::"Huh...?"::
12793::$$$message_0100_0010_0000$$$::"Can't you tell? It's my part-time job. You have one too, right? It's nothing strange."[lr]::
12794::$$$message_0100_0010_0001$$$::"It's strange that your apron looks good on you..."::
12795::$$$message_0100_0011_0000$$$::"Don't say that. It's not the day and age where if you go knocking on other people's doors, they'll just let you in for a drink and a meal. [cacheimage storage=ランサーエプロン花屋01a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=ランサーエプロン花屋01a(中)]I gotta at least earn my own drinking allowance."[lr]::
12796::$$$message_0100_0011_0001$$$::"...That's true. You have it tough, too."::
12797::$$$message_0100_0012_0000$$$::"Yeah. Well, there are some perks. They do say that you can even get enthusiastic scattering bait."[lr]::
12798::$$$message_0100_0012_0001$$$::Lancer points at the display of the store, as if to ask how it is.[lr]::
12799::$$$message_0100_0012_0002$$$::What kind of perks?::
12800::$$$message_0100_0013_0000$$$::"...Do you know him?"[lr]::
12801::$$$message_0100_0013_0001$$$::"I don't really want to, but..."[lr]::
12802::$$$message_0100_0013_0002$$$::"Hm. You seem pretty close."::
12803::$$$message_0100_0014_0000$$$::"Welcome, Miss. Are you in need of flowers?"[lr]::
12804::$$$message_0100_0014_0001$$$::"Huh...oh, just a bouquet to visit someone in the hospital...[cacheimage storage=美綴01a(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 storage=美綴01a(中) pos=r time=300]how much would it cost?"[lr]::
12805::$$$message_0100_0014_0002$$$::Mitsuzuri puts two fingers up.[lr]::
12806::$$$message_0100_0014_0003$$$::Lancer nods and chooses the flowers efficiently.[lr]::
12807::$$$message_0100_0014_0004$$$::...He's actually being the store clerk of a flower shop.::
12808::$$$message_0100_0015_0000$$$::"Someone in the hospital? You seem to be a Homurahara student, but did something unfortunate happen to your friend or something?"[lr]::
12809::$$$message_0100_0015_0001$$$::"Umm, someone from my club. I'm in the kyudo club."[lr]::
12810::$$$message_0100_0015_0002$$$::"What...!?"::
12811::$$$message_0100_0016_0000$$$::"Khh... What admirable dedication it is to give flowers to your compatriot that you fight alongside in this day and age where there are no social obligations.[lr]::
12812::$$$message_0100_0016_0001$$$::I haven't been able to get along with archers lately, but I think I'd be able to get along with you!"::
12813::$$$message_0100_0017_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
12814::$$$message_0100_0017_0001$$$::This man must be thinking that kyudo club is some combat massacre group that has each other's backs.::
12815::$$$message_0100_0018_0000$$$::"You're gonna make them cry. Actually, they're gonna cry. I can imagine them dying, thinking about how being cared for by a woman like you is a blessing in disguise!"[lr]::
12816::$$$message_0100_0018_0001$$$::"They didn't die. I don't want a flower offering... Ugh, what are you making!?"[lr]::
12817::$$$message_0100_0018_0002$$$::I stop Lancer from choosing funeral flowers.[lr]::
12818::$$$message_0100_0018_0003$$$::...But to be honest, he does have pretty good taste in bouquet making.::
12819::$$$message_0100_0019_0000$$$::"A warrior... [cacheimage storage=美綴01a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg storage=美綴01a(中) pos=r time=400 textoff=0]Do you do any martial arts too, Mr. Clerk?"[lr]::
12820::$$$message_0100_0019_0001$$$::"Huh? Well, I did it all; from sword fighting, to using a bow, to using a tank. [cacheimage storage=ランサーエプロン花屋01a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=ランサーエプロン花屋01a(中)]Although my main profession is using a spear."[lr]::
12821::$$$message_0100_0019_0002$$$::"Spearmanship? Is it an ancient martial art?"[lr]::
12822::$$$message_0100_0019_0003$$$::"...?"[lr]::
12823::$$$message_0100_0019_0004$$$::He makes an expression as if wondering what that is.::
12824::$$$message_0100_0020_0000$$$::"...Mitsuzuri. Doesn't that kinda stuff not matter?[lr]::
12825::$$$message_0100_0020_0001$$$::More than that, can you actually make the get-well flowers?"[lr]::
12826::$$$message_0100_0020_0002$$$::"What, Emiya? You sound dissatisfied. What's wrong with enjoying martial arts?"::
12827::$$$message_0100_0021_0000$$$::"Haha, I had a little something with him, so he's still holding a grudge. [cacheimage storage=ランサーエプロン花屋01b(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=ランサーエプロン花屋01b(中)]He's so persistent, geez. He should put up with it since he's alive."[lr]::
12828::$$$message_0100_0021_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
12829::$$$message_0100_0021_0002$$$::What a terrifying theory.[lr]::
12830::$$$message_0100_0021_0003$$$::Is he some gambler pretending not to know while piercing through a person's heart, saying, "It's not murder if I don't get caught"?::
12831::$$$message_0100_0022_0000$$$::"Emiya. I don't know why, but I don't admire holding grudges about matches. Even if you quit kyudo, I don't want you to forget the mentality of a martial artist at the very least.[lr]::
12832::$$$message_0100_0022_0001$$$::Just because you had a little something, why are you sulking that much?"[lr]::
12833::$$$message_0100_0022_0002$$$::Fool.[lr]::
12834::$$$message_0100_0022_0003$$$::If you think you can just sweep everything under the rug because I'm still alive, then this world is no better than a stirring coliseum.::
12835::$$$message_0100_0023_0000$$$::"But it's my first time meeting a spearman. I use a polearm."[lr]::
12836::$$$message_0100_0023_0001$$$::"Yeah. Come to think of it, that's your number one specialty, huh?"[lr]::
12837::$$$message_0100_0023_0002$$$::"Yeah, there's a strong impression that it's a martial art for powerless girls, so it's a martial art that doesn't have much to do with boys."::
12838::$$$message_0100_0024_0000$$$::"I see. So it's like a halberd... [cacheimage storage=ランサーエプロン花屋01b(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=ランサーエプロン花屋01b(中)]But you know, there's no such thing as men or women in warriors. That's just about whether it suits you or not. At any rate, my spear is[line len=2]"[lr]::
12839::$$$message_0100_0024_0001$$$::"Hey, wait. That is[line len=2]"::
12840::$$$message_0100_0025_0000$$$::"...Hrrk!"[lr]::
12841::$$$message_0100_0025_0001$$$::He effortlessly and smoothly swings a spear close to two meters as if handling a flower arrangement tool.[lr]::
12842::$$$message_0100_0025_0002$$$::The spear transforms into a whip with just the snap of the wrist, and it flies freely through the store[line len=2]::
12843::$$$message_0100_0026_0000$$$::"As you can see, this was handed down directly from one female warrior. Though it's unfortunate that she's not known very well in this country."[lr]::
12844::$$$message_0100_0026_0001$$$::Without letting a single petal fall from the store interior which is covered in flowers, he grabs only the flowers that he wants.::
12845::$$$message_0100_0027_0000$$$::"...That's a rare trans[line len=2]I mean, yes."[lr]::
12846::$$$message_0100_0027_0001$$$::It's more rare for someone to get a spear out to cut flowers.::
12847::$$$message_0100_0028_0000$$$::"So, can I take it that we're long-handled spear buddies?"[lr]::
12848::$$$message_0100_0028_0001$$$::"T-That would be an honor! Compared to your wonderful spearmanship skills, [cacheimage storage=美綴02c(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=美綴02c(中)]I am[line len=2]"[lr]::
12849::$$$message_0100_0028_0002$$$::"Well, more than his skills, his lack of common sense of swinging around a spear in a flower shop is..."[lr]::
12850::$$$message_0100_0028_0003$$$::What, even Mitsuzuri is going insane.::
12851::$$$message_0100_0029_0000$$$::"Um, where did you learn your spearmanship? If you can please tell me... Um, I would love to hear."[lr]::
12852::$$$message_0100_0029_0001$$$::"I have enough stories to tell as the flowers here, enough to sell...[wvl][se volume=80 storage=se359.wav][cacheimage storage=ランサーエプロン花屋01g(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 textoff=0 storage=ランサーエプロン花屋01g(中)] All right, it's finished."[lr]::
12853::$$$message_0100_0029_0002$$$::"Oh..."[lr]::
12854::$$$message_0100_0029_0003$$$::Lancer hands her the completed bouquet.::
12855::$$$message_0100_0030_0000$$$::"It's soft and kind... I can feel the emotions of the person who made it. Even though you're such a great fighter."[lr]::
12856::$$$message_0100_0030_0001$$$::Mitsuzuri looks at the flowers in awe.::
12857::$$$message_0100_0031_0000$$$::"...Hm, it is nice after all."[lr]::
12858::$$$message_0100_0031_0001$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
12859::$$$message_0100_0031_0002$$$::"Flowers look great with a beautiful martial artist. It's what you call eye candy."[lr]::
12860::$$$message_0100_0031_0003$$$::Lancer laughs while brushing off his apron.::
12861::$$$message_0100_0032_0000$$$::"Oh..."[lr]::
12862::$$$message_0100_0032_0001$$$::"It's not flattery. It's my true feelings."[lr]::
12863::$$$message_0100_0032_0002$$$::"Haha... [cacheimage storage=美綴02i頬(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=美綴02i頬(中)]But, I don't feel bad hearing you say that."::
12864::$$$message_0100_0033_0000$$$::Mitsuzuri is smiling happily.[lr]::
12865::$$$message_0100_0033_0001$$$::I've known Mitsuzuri since we got into Homurahara, but this is my first time seeing her act so feminine.::
12866::$$$message_0100_0034_0000$$$::"Then, this is for you."[lr]::
12867::$$$message_0100_0034_0001$$$::He hands a surprised Mitsuzuri a single flower.[lr]::
12868::$$$message_0100_0034_0002$$$::"Um, what is this?"[lr]::
12869::$$$message_0100_0034_0003$$$::"This is my thoughtful present for you who thinks of your comrade...did I misjudge you? Do you not like amber-colored flowers?"[lr]::
12870::$$$message_0100_0034_0004$$$::"Um, well, that's not it... [cacheimage storage=美綴02d頬(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=美綴02d頬(中)]I was just a bit surprised."::
12871::$$$message_0100_0035_0000$$$::"Come to think of it, I haven't asked for your name. I'm... Well, call me Lancer. That's what I go by now."[lr]::
12872::$$$message_0100_0035_0001$$$::"Y-Yes. M-[cacheimage storage=美綴02i頬(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 storage=美綴02i頬(中) pos=r time=300]my name is[line len=2]"::
12873::$$$message_0100_0036_0000$$$::"Ayako..."[lr]::
12874::$$$message_0100_0036_0001$$$::"WAHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH!"::
12875::$$$message_0100_0037_0000$$$::"R-Rider?"[lr]::
12876::$$$message_0100_0037_0001$$$::"Huh? Why are you here!?"[lr]::
12877::$$$message_0100_0037_0002$$$::"Heheh, I work in this neighborhood. Then I was drawn by the scent of you and the flowers[line len=2]"[lr]::
12878::$$$message_0100_0037_0003$$$::"Oh, the flowers! Then please take your time and choose[line len=2]"::
12879::$$$message_0100_0038_0000$$$::"No, I came out to get lunch, [cacheimage storage=ライダーエプロン04d(近)b][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=ライダーエプロン04d(近)b]so I came for you more than flowers."[lr]::
12880::$$$message_0100_0038_0001$$$::"What does lunch have to do with me!?"::
12881::$$$message_0100_0039_0000$$$::...Rider's usual habit came out.[lr]::
12882::$$$message_0100_0039_0001$$$::It seems like she likes Mitsuzuri, so she pursued her.::
12883::$$$message_0100_0040_0000$$$::"I wanted to fall in love normally!"[lr]::
12884::$$$message_0100_0040_0001$$$::"What!?[lr]::
12885::$$$message_0100_0040_0002$$$::Hey, Miss!?[wvl][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-3] The flowers! [wvl][shock vmax=20 time=500 count=-6]You haven't paid!"::
12886::$$$message_0100_0041_0000$$$::Mitsuzuri runs away.[lr]::
12887::$$$message_0100_0041_0001$$$::I was able to see all kinds of unexpected sides of Mitsuzuri today.[lr]::
12888::$$$message_0100_0041_0002$$$::"...I wonder what I'm supposed to do as the one who was keeping her company."::

